    <!-- The "Upscaling" choice as a Klang sheet: one explanation per choice, in the order of the entries. -->
    <string name="video_settings_upscaler_info">Detail plus runs on the device only, from 1.5× enlargement. If it gets too slow, Lanczos takes over.</string>
    <string-array name="video_settings_upscaler_summaries">
        <item>Lanczos 3 enlarges sharply and quickly, on every device.</item>
        <item>A small network brings back fine detail in films and series. Uses more battery.</item>
        <item>A network for clean lines and flat colours. Uses more battery.</item>
        <item>Chooses for each video: Detail plus when the device is fast enough, cartoon for anime, otherwise Lanczos.</item>
    </string-array>
